      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Flasher%2C_North_Dakota",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Flasher Historical Society, founded in 1967, preserves the town’s heritage with a free, digitized archive of historic newspapers.",
